flowchart LR
 API[Read-only Tasker API capture] --> S[Frozen source snapshot]
 D[Corpus profile notes] --> S
 S --> R[BM25 dense RRF]
 R --> N[Note shortlist ≤20 and bounded selection]
 N --> T[5 bounded typed Tasker tool loops]
 T --> P[5 isolated initial positions]
 P --> C[Coordinator immutable draft]
 C --> V[5 isolated current-version reviews]
 V --> G{Deterministic guard}
 G -->|All five approve| Y[Consensus user report plus trace]
 G -->|Objections and rounds remain| C
 G -->|Round limit| X[No consensus plus dissent]
 G -->|Invalid source model budget| F[Failed incomplete cancelled]
